{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017jkfxRdFwy28hN4gSjoskk","type":"tool_result","content":"/bin/bash: /etc/bash.bashrc: Permission denied\nmetais reads, validates and renders METAIS packages, and helps author them.\n\nUsage:\n  metais <command> [operands] [flags]\n\nGolden paths:\n  Consuming a package: inspect → read → schema → validate → render\n  Authoring a package: init → edit (preview with render --sample) → check → test\n  → pack\n\nCommands:\n  Reading a package:\n    inspect   Print what a supplier reads first: the package's identity, its\n              guide, its inputs, outputs, references and examples, and the\n              commands to run next.\n    ls        List the entries under a path of a package.\n    read      Print an entry of a package, or a range of its lines.\n    outline   List the headings of a Markdown entry, each with the lines of its\n              section.\n    grep      Search a package's entries for a regular expression, with context.\n    schema    Print the package's combined input schema, or one input's schema.\n    extract   Write the entries the globs select to a directory.\n  Supplying and rendering:\n    validate  Validate inputs against a package, and report every finding at\n              once.\n    render    Render the package's outputs from the inputs supplied, into a\n              directory or to standard output.\n  Authoring:\n    init      Write a new package's source directory, with an input, a template\n              and an example.\n    check     Check a package without data, and report every finding of every\n              step at once.\n    sample    Generate sample data from the inputs' schemas, and keep it as a\n              data directory or an example.\n    test      Render every example of a package and compare it with the outputs\n              it should produce.\n    pack      Check and test a source directory, then write it as one package\n              file.\n    unpack    Write a packed package's source directory, to edit it.\n  The tool:\n    version   Print the tool's version and the specification versions it\n              implements.\n    limits    List every resource limit, with its default, unit and class.\n    skill     Write metais's agent skill, which teaches a coding agent the\n              golden paths, where the agent's harness reads skills.\n    help      Print the overview, a command's help, or a topic.\n\nGlobal flags:\n  --json\n      Print the result as one JSON document on standard output.\n{\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"inputs/invoice.schema.json\": {\n      \"$defs\": {\n        \"party\": {\n          \"additionalProperties\": false,\n          \"description\": \"A person or organization named on the invoice.\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"address\": {\n              \"description\": \"The party's postal address, on one line, as the invoice prints it.\",\n              \"examples\": [\n                \"Keizersgracht 1, 1015 CC Amsterdam, Netherlands\"\n              ],\n              \"maxLength\": 300,\n              \"minLength\": 1,\n              \"title\": \"Address\",\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"name\": {\n              \"description\": \"The party's name, as the invoice prints it.\",\n              \"examples\": [\n                \"Example Consulting B.V.\"\n              ],\n              \"maxLength\": 120,\n              \"minLength\": 1,\n              \"title\": \"Name\",\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"name\",\n            \"address\"\n          ],\n          \"title\": \"Party\",\n          \"type\": \"object\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"$id\": \"metais:///inputs/invoice.schema.json\",\n      \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"description\": \"One invoice: its number, when it was issued, who issued it and to whom, the currency of its amounts, the items it invoices, and optionally notes.\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"buyer\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/party\",\n          \"description\": \"Who the invoice is issued to and is to pay.\",\n          \"title\": \"Buyer\"\n        },\n        \"currency\": {\n          \"description\": \"The currency of every amount on the invoice, as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            \"EUR\"\n          ],\n          \"pattern\": \"^[A-Z]{3}$\",\n          \"title\": \"Currency\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"issued\": {\n          \"description\": \"The date the invoice was issued, as an RFC 3339 full-date. The invoice prints it as given.\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            \"2026-10-21\"\n          ],\n          \"format\": \"date\",\n          \"title\": \"Issued\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"lines\": {\n          \"description\": \"The items invoiced, in the order the table lists them.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"description\": {\n                \"description\": \"What the line invoices, as the table prints it.\",\n                \"examples\": [\n                  \"Consulting, October\"\n                ],\n                \"maxLength\": 200,\n                \"minLength\": 1,\n                \"title\": \"Description\",\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"quantity\": {\n                \"description\": \"How many units the line invoices: hours, days or items. It may be fractional.\",\n                \"examples\": [\n                  12\n                ],\n                \"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n                \"title\": \"Quantity\",\n                \"type\": \"number\"\n              },\n              \"unit_price\": {\n                \"description\": \"The price of one unit, in the invoice's currency.\",\n                \"examples\": [\n                  95\n                ],\n                \"minimum\": 0,\n                \"title\": \"Unit price\",\n                \"type\": \"number\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"description\",\n              \"quantity\",\n              \"unit_price\"\n            ],\n            \"type\": \"object\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 100,\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"title\": \"Lines\",\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        \"notes\": {\n          \"description\": \"Anything the buyer should read beside the amounts, such as how to pay. Left out, the invoice prints no notes.\",\n          \"maxLength\": 1000,\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"title\": \"Notes\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"number\": {\n          \"description\": \"The number the seller gave the invoice, as the heading prints it.\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            \"INV-2026-0042\"\n          ],\n          \"maxLength\": 40,\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"title\": \"Invoice number\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"seller\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/party\",\n          \"description\": \"Who issues the invoice and is to be paid.\",\n          \"title\": \"Seller\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"number\",\n        \"issued\",\n        \"seller\",\n        \"buyer\",\n        \"currency\",\n        \"lines\"\n      ],\n      \"title\": \"Invoice\",\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"$ref\": \"metais:///inputs/invoice.schema.json\",\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"description\": \"One invoice, as the billing program that issues it holds it.\",\n  \"title\": \"Invoice\"\n}\n\nNext:\n  metais validate <package> --data <dir>  — Validates the inputs you gathered in a data directory again