{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MzpEy2eENmhVRpejt1KCEt","type":"tool_result","content":"/bin/bash: /etc/bash.bashrc: Permission denied\nWrote 10 files:\n  examples/basic/example.yaml\n  examples/basic/expected/invoice.html\n  examples/basic/inputs/invoice.json\n  examples/escaping/example.yaml\n./metais.yaml\n./references/sources.md\n./templates/invoice.html.liquid\n./inputs/invoice.schema.json\n./examples/basic/example.yaml\n./examples/escaping/example.yaml\n./examples/basic/expected/invoice.html\n./examples/basic/inputs/invoice.json\n./examples/escaping/expected/invoice.html\n./examples/escaping/inputs/invoice.json\nmetais: \"1.0\"\nname: \"invoice\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\ntitle: \"Invoice\"\ndescription: \"Renders one HTML invoice, with a line for each item and their total, from a JSON object a program supplies.\"\nlicense: \"Apache-2.0\"\nguide: |-\n  This package renders invoice.html, an HTML page that prints one invoice:\n  its number and the date it was issued, the seller and the buyer, a table\n  of the items invoiced with each line's amount, the total, and optional\n  notes. The page carries class names and no style of its own.\n\n  It is written for a program, not a person. A billing job reads the\n  invoice from wherever it is kept, writes it as invoice.json in a data\n  directory, and runs two commands:\n\n      metais validate invoice --data data\n      metais render invoice --data data --out out\n\n  validate reports every value that does not fit the\n  [invoice schema](inputs/invoice.schema.json), and render writes\n  out/invoice.html. Every value is HTML-escaped, so a name, an address, a\n  description or a note may hold any text.\n\n  Each line's amount is its quantity times its unit price, and the total is\n  the sum of the amounts; the program supplies neither. Every amount is in\n  the invoice's one currency, given as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\n  Leave notes out when there is nothing to add.\ninputs:\n  - name: invoice\n    title: \"Invoice\"\n    description: \"One invoice, as the billing program that issues it holds it.\"\n    schema: inputs/invoice.schema.json\n    forms:\n      - json\noutputs:\n  - id: invoice\n    template: invoice.html.liquid\n    escape: html\n{%- assign inv = inputs.invoice -%}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article class=\"invoice\">\n  <h1>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</h1>\n  <p class=\"invoice-issued\">Issued <time datetime=\"{{ inv.issued }}\">{{ inv.issued }}</time></p>\n  <section class=\"invoice-seller\">\n    <h2>From</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.seller.name }}<br>{{ inv.seller.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"invoice-buyer\">\n    <h2>To</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.buyer.name }}<br>{{ inv.buyer.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <table class=\"invoice-lines\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n{%- assign total = 0 %}\n{%- for line in inv.lines %}\n{%- assign amount = line.quantity | times: line.unit_price %}\n{%- assign total = total | plus: amount %}\n      <tr><td>{{ line.description }}</td><td>{{ line.quantity }}</td><td>{{ line.unit_price }} {{ inv.currency }}</td><td>{{ amount }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n{%- endfor %}\n    </tbody>\n    <tfoot>\n      <tr><th colspan=\"3\">Total</th><td>{{ total }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n    </tfoot>\n  </table>\n{%- if inv.notes %}\n  <p class=\"invoice-notes\">{{ inv.notes }}</p>\n{%- endif %}\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\ntitle: Two lines, no notes\ndescription: An invoice for two lines of work, one with a fractional quantity, and no notes, so the invoice shows its parties, its lines and their total.\ntitle: Text to escape, with notes\ndescription: An invoice whose names, a line's description and its notes hold text that must be HTML-escaped.\n{\n  \"number\": \"INV-2026-0042\",\n  \"issued\": \"2026-10-21\",\n  \"seller\": {\"name\": \"Example Consulting B.V.\", \"address\": \"Keizersgracht 1, 1015 CC Amsterdam, Netherlands\"},\n  \"buyer\": {\"name\": \"Sample Retail GmbH\", \"address\": \"Hauptstrasse 5, 10115 Berlin, Germany\"},\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\"description\": \"Consulting, October\", \"quantity\": 12, \"unit_price\": 95},\n    {\"description\": \"Workshop day\", \"quantity\": 1.5, \"unit_price\": 800}\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"number\": \"INV-2026-0043\",\n  \"issued\": \"2026-10-21\",\n  \"seller\": {\"name\": \"Smith & Jones <Design>\", \"address\": \"1 Market Street, Springfield\"},\n  \"buyer\": {\"name\": \"O'Brien \\\"Studio\\\" Ltd\", \"address\": \"2 Harbour Road, Shelbyville\"},\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\"description\": \"Logo <draft> & revisions\", \"quantity\": 3, \"unit_price\": 250},\n    {\"description\": \"Print proofs\", \"quantity\": 10, \"unit_price\": 2.5}\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Pay by bank transfer & quote the invoice number.\"\n}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Invoice INV-2026-0042</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article class=\"invoice\">\n  <h1>Invoice INV-2026-0042</h1>\n  <p class=\"invoice-issued\">Issued <time datetime=\"2026-10-21\">2026-10-21</time></p>\n  <section class=\"invoice-seller\">\n    <h2>From</h2>\n    <p>Example Consulting B.V.<br>Keizersgracht 1, 1015 CC Amsterdam, Netherlands</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"invoice-buyer\">\n    <h2>To</h2>\n    <p>Sample Retail GmbH<br>Hauptstrasse 5, 10115 Berlin, Germany</p>\n  </section>\n  <table class=\"invoice-lines\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Consulting, October</td><td>12</td><td>95 EUR</td><td>1140 EUR</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Workshop day</td><td>1.5</td><td>800 EUR</td><td>1200.0 EUR</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    <tfoot>\n      <tr><th colspan=\"3\">Total</th><td>2340.0 EUR</td></tr>\n    </tfoot>\n  </table>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4dde7ed6-a656-48ee-979d-1bd9908210ab","uuid":"4d9e3271-edb0-4e66-afd3-f66d46a93a03","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:05:23.467Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/bin/bash: /etc/bash.bashrc: Permission denied\nWrote 10 files:\n  examples/basic/example.yaml\n  examples/basic/expected/invoice.html\n  examples/basic/inputs/invoice.json\n  examples/escaping/example.yaml\n./metais.yaml\n./references/sources.md\n./templates/invoice.html.liquid\n./inputs/invoice.schema.json\n./examples/basic/example.yaml\n./examples/escaping/example.yaml\n./examples/basic/expected/invoice.html\n./examples/basic/inputs/invoice.json\n./examples/escaping/expected/invoice.html\n./examples/escaping/inputs/invoice.json\nmetais: \"1.0\"\nname: \"invoice\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\ntitle: \"Invoice\"\ndescription: \"Renders one HTML invoice, with a line for each item and their total, from a JSON object a program supplies.\"\nlicense: \"Apache-2.0\"\nguide: |-\n  This package renders invoice.html, an HTML page that prints one invoice:\n  its number and the date it was issued, the seller and the buyer, a table\n  of the items invoiced with each line's amount, the total, and optional\n  notes. The page carries class names and no style of its own.\n\n  It is written for a program, not a person. A billing job reads the\n  invoice from wherever it is kept, writes it as invoice.json in a data\n  directory, and runs two commands:\n\n      metais validate invoice --data data\n      metais render invoice --data data --out out\n\n  validate reports every value that does not fit the\n  [invoice schema](inputs/invoice.schema.json), and render writes\n  out/invoice.html. Every value is HTML-escaped, so a name, an address, a\n  description or a note may hold any text.\n\n  Each line's amount is its quantity times its unit price, and the total is\n  the sum of the amounts; the program supplies neither. Every amount is in\n  the invoice's one currency, given as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\n  Leave notes out when there is nothing to add.\ninputs:\n  - name: invoice\n    title: \"Invoice\"\n    description: \"One invoice, as the billing program that issues it holds it.\"\n    schema: inputs/invoice.schema.json\n    forms:\n      - json\noutputs:\n  - id: invoice\n    template: invoice.html.liquid\n    escape: html\n{%- assign inv = inputs.invoice -%}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article class=\"invoice\">\n  <h1>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</h1>\n  <p class=\"invoice-issued\">Issued <time datetime=\"{{ inv.issued }}\">{{ inv.issued }}</time></p>\n  <section class=\"invoice-seller\">\n    <h2>From</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.seller.name }}<br>{{ inv.seller.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"invoice-buyer\">\n    <h2>To</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.buyer.name }}<br>{{ inv.buyer.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <table class=\"invoice-lines\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n{%- assign total = 0 %}\n{%- for line in inv.lines %}\n{%- assign amount = line.quantity | times: line.unit_price %}\n{%- assign total = total | plus: amount %}\n      <tr><td>{{ line.description }}</td><td>{{ line.quantity }}</td><td>{{ line.unit_price }} {{ inv.currency }}</td><td>{{ amount }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n{%- endfor %}\n    </tbody>\n    <tfoot>\n      <tr><th colspan=\"3\">Total</th><td>{{ total }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n    </tfoot>\n  </table>\n{%- if inv.notes %}\n  <p class=\"invoice-notes\">{{ inv.notes }}</p>\n{%- endif %}\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\ntitle: Two lines, no notes\ndescription: An invoice for two lines of work, one with a fractional quantity, and no notes, so the invoice shows its parties, its lines and their total.\ntitle: Text to escape, with notes\ndescription: An invoice whose names, a line's description and its notes hold text that must be HTML-escaped.\n{\n  \"number\": \"INV-2026-0042\",\n  \"issued\": \"2026-10-21\",\n  \"seller\": {\"name\": \"Example Consulting B.V.\", \"address\": \"Keizersgracht 1, 1015 CC Amsterdam, Netherlands\"},\n  \"buyer\": {\"name\": \"Sample Retail GmbH\", \"address\": \"Hauptstrasse 5, 10115 Berlin, Germany\"},\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\"description\": \"Consulting, October\", \"quantity\": 12, \"unit_price\": 95},\n    {\"description\": \"Workshop day\", \"quantity\": 1.5, \"unit_price\": 800}\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"number\": \"INV-2026-0043\",\n  \"issued\": \"2026-10-21\",\n  \"seller\": {\"name\": \"Smith & Jones <Design>\", \"address\": \"1 Market Street, Springfield\"},\n  \"buyer\": {\"name\": \"O'Brien \\\"Studio\\\" Ltd\", \"address\": \"2 Harbour Road, Shelbyville\"},\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\"description\": \"Logo <draft> & revisions\", \"quantity\": 3, \"unit_price\": 250},\n    {\"description\": \"Print proofs\", \"quantity\": 10, \"unit_price\": 2.5}\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Pay by bank transfer & quote the invoice number.\"\n}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Invoice INV-2026-0042</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article class=\"invoice\">\n  <h1>Invoice INV-2026-0042</h1>\n  <p class=\"invoice-issued\">Issued <time datetime=\"2026-10-21\">2026-10-21</time></p>\n  <section class=\"invoice-seller\">\n    <h2>From</h2>\n    <p>Example Consulting B.V.<br>Keizersgracht 1, 1015 CC Amsterdam, Netherlands</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"invoice-buyer\">\n    <h2>To</h2>\n    <p>Sample Retail GmbH<br>Hauptstrasse 5, 10115 Berlin, Germany</p>\n  </section>\n  <table class=\"invoice-lines\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Consulting, October</td><td>12</td><td>95 EUR</td><td>1140 EUR</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Workshop day</td><td>1.5</td><td>800 EUR</td><td>1200.0 EUR</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    <tfoot>\n      <tr><th colspan=\"3\">Total</th><td>2340.0 EUR</td></tr>\n    </tfoot>\n  </table>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MzpEy2eENmhVRpejt1KCEt","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
